Zapbar protocol notes

The Android TV Remote v2 pairing and command messages follow the behavior of
androidtvremote2 (https://github.com/tronikos/androidtvremote2), Apache License 2.0.
The Swift in this repository was written for Zapbar. That project is not copied in.

The ADB connection, AUTH signature (RSA_sign with SHA-1, PKCS#1 v1.5), public key
layout, and sync stream follow the Android Open Source Project adb sources
(https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/adb/), Apache License 2.0.
The Swift in this repository was written for Zapbar. Those C++ sources are not copied in.

